PASS boot_straps_00: BOOT-SEL[1:0] = 00 (SPI NOR first): PC4 and PC5 each have one populated pull-down <= 3.6k to GND and no pull-up
PASS spi0_t35_isolated: no T35 (U18) pin on any F133 SPI0 net; every other driver on PC4/PC5 is the NOR or a 3-state buffer
PASS nor_boot_device: 32 MiB NOR on SPI0 CS0 with /RESET pulled up + FEL button, IO2/IO3 pulled up, CS# pulled up
PASS mn820_miso_buffered: F133 PD13 (BT_MISO) is driven by a 3-state buffer from the module, never by the module connector directly
PASS switched_domain_pullups: pull-ups on nets that touch a switched-domain IC go to that domain's rail (no back-power)
PASS psram_power_architecture: PSRAM VDD switched by a load switch whose ON = AND(F133 request, delayed CDONE); supervisor PG to the T35;
PASS power_sequencing: F133 core/DRAM bucks enabled by the 3V3 supervisor; F133 RESET by the core supervisor;
PASS usb_device_only: corrective D-04: USB1 (host) unconnected; no load switch sources VBUS; USB0 D+/D- reach the connector with ESD
PASS sd_is_not_boot: microSD on SMHC0 (PF0-PF5) for games; BOOT-SEL 00 never tries SMHC0; card detect present
PASS every_ic_decoupled: every power_in net of an IC has at least one 100nF capacitor
PASS components_traceable: every populated part carries an MPN or an explicit TBD, a footprint, and an evidence tag
R08 board rules: 11/11 PASS (self-authored rules, not independent validation)
